<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Payment Method is Expiring Soon</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #0F172A; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f7; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .warning-box { background: #fffbeb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; text-align: center; }
        .warning-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .card-info { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .card-icon { font-size: 32px; }
        .card-details { text-align: left; }
        .card-brand { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172A; }
        .card-number { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; }
        .expiry-badge { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; }
        .countdown { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .countdown-number { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b; }
        .countdown-label { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #85182F; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 16px; }
        .btn:hover { background: #6D1427; }
        .info-box { background: #eff6ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
        .info-box p { margin: 0; color: #1e40af; font-size: 14px; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
        .footer a { color: #85182F; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">💳</div>
            <h1>Payment Method Expiring</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
            
            <p>We wanted to give you a heads up that your payment method on file is expiring soon.</p>
            
            <div class="warning-box">
                <div class="warning-title">Card Expiration Notice</div>
                <div class="card-info">
                    <div class="card-icon">💳</div>
                    <div class="card-details">
                        <div class="card-brand">{{cardBrand}}</div>
                        <div class="card-number">•••• •••• •••• {{cardLast4}}</div>
                        <span class="expiry-badge">Expires {{expiryMonth}}/{{expiryYear}}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="countdown">
                <div class="countdown-number">{{daysUntilExpiry}}</div>
                <div class="countdown-label">days until expiration</div>
            </div>
            
            <p>To ensure uninterrupted service, please update your payment method before your card expires.</p>
            
            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{updatePaymentUrl}}" class="btn">Update Payment Method</a>
            </p>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p>💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> If you've already received a new card with a new expiration date but the same card number, you may just need to update the expiration date in your account settings.</p>
            </div>
            
            {{#if nextBillingDate}}
            <p>Your next billing date is <strong>{{nextBillingDate}}</strong>. Please ensure your payment method is updated before this date.</p>
            {{/if}}
            
            <p>Thank you for being a valued customer!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>{{companyName}} • {{companyAddress}}</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}">Billing Portal</a> • 
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a> • 
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Email Preferences</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

